  "details": "The idea is to reward players who have been playing the game or subscribed for a long time, one year subscribers can lets say get a Vrchat rat plushie ( I̶ ̶j̶u̶s̶t̶ ̶w̶a̶n̶t̶ ̶a̶ ̶e̶x̶c̶u̶s̶e̶ ̶f̶o̶r̶ ̶p̶l̶u̶s̶h̶i̶e̶s̶) \n\nEvery year of subscribing you can unlock cool rewards for loyal players stuff you can show off to your friends.\n\nNostalgic rewards for players who played for every five years\n\nSomething very special for players for the upcoming ten year badge for a lot of players who have stuck with the game since 2018 that was around the large wave players entered the game, I would say what ever item or object should represent the memories we had back then.",
